OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain will affect parts of
OL,6,FScotland and northern England at
OL,7,Ftimes. Elsewhere, showers will become
OL,8,Fincreasingly widespread, locally heavy
OL,9,Fwith isolated thunder, alongside sunny
OL,10,Fspells. Breezy, with strong winds
OL,11,Fpossible near some coasts.
OL,12,FTemperatures near average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny remaining shower will
OL,15,Fease overnight leaving patch cloud and
OL,16,Fclearer spells. Rain moving into the
OL,17,Fsouthwest later and winds increase.
OL,18,FStaying warm for many overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
