OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FOccasionally heavy rain
OL,6,Fmoves east across England and Wales.
OL,7,FBrighter conditions follow in the
OL,8,Fsouth with heavy, possibly thundery
OL,9,Fshowers. Rain moves north, but stays
OL,10,Fmostly dry for Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
